{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01WG", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-closed-immersion-finite}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:4a8c62353b7d47832beeb261bac838137b9d5132551b094818d86daf041a95a1", "source_text": "A closed immersion is finite (and a fortiori integral).\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e24b81e4748fb76e21a19ad4b2d5f1561c446f1b1a133f5bc27ee2e265740582", "unit_id": "tag:035C:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01WG", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-closed-immersion-affine}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:2fd27457e1a24358102afa9f040ff1c60439619ef31b4b1ef9bac1e7ce1dce04", "source_text": "True because a closed immersion is affine\n(Lemma <REF_0001>)\nand a surjective ring map is finite and integral.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3b7969cc42ca51b60924026d8ab1c0fa8b6237fbcddc9c142cd6dfc7bad50ae4", "unit_id": "tag:035C:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01WG", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X_i \\to Y$", "MATH_0002": "$i = 1, \\ldots, n$", "MATH_0003": "$X_1 \\amalg \\ldots \\amalg X_n \\to Y$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-finite-union-finite}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:a12545cc6a471d9d781160530d39242e0d8e2a0dbdae1be2a3a29787ead4266e", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:ff0bbeb3a4b55cb7a8c124886315d114578a71fb03aad1c80180a73fb1e4d1ff", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001>, <MATH_0002> be finite morphisms of schemes.\nThen <MATH_0003> is finite too.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f1331c009544939bedd8f764be81cd641fa78831c74ba7e8b5c947fa86e33033", "unit_id": "tag:0CYI:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01WG", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$R \\to A_i$", "MATH_0002": "$i = 1, \\ldots, n$", "MATH_0003": "$R \\to A_1 \\times \\ldots \\times A_n$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:942e1cfcd80df3b8ea3bb3a369b4923d127efaae547e38f60a6348d7c809760c", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:0b324b8d88756b79e8b3eb07407a52c62d9d54017bfb9f920bbbb07bb9cc3e17", "source_text": "Follows from the algebra fact that if <MATH_0001>, <MATH_0002>\nare finite ring maps, then <MATH_0003> is finite too.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:700923fc222acbe055dac0a1d42cd2dd5fd259df3637fbbe578c3d44fe4e8594", "unit_id": "tag:0CYI:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01WG", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to Y$", "MATH_0002": "$g : Y \\to Z$", "MATH_0003": "$g \\circ f$", "MATH_0004": "$g$", "MATH_0005": "$f$", "MATH_0006": "$g \\circ f$", "MATH_0007": "$g$", "MATH_0008": "$f$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-finite-permanence}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:0ad9a9cc4b0dd5db210e3cf97ae4c673a7d16b062b9a0f0302263677fd634e24", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:293d9fe207af7b0c9e08b0981bf1d291b520ce84fbe529e2a0bf728dfd98ff6f", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> and <MATH_0002> be morphisms.\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> If <MATH_0003> is finite and <MATH_0004> separated then <MATH_0005> is finite.\n<STRUCT_0003> If <MATH_0006> is integral and <MATH_0007> separated then <MATH_0008> is integral.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:efe49441ebc54c80090115d8be5082cec2929251a83c576770c58f32cbd9e2b0", "unit_id": "tag:035D:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01WG", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$g \\circ f$", "MATH_0002": "$g$", "MATH_0003": "$X \\times_Z Y \\to Y$", "MATH_0004": "$X \\to X \\times_Z Y$", "MATH_0005": "$Y \\to Z$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-base-change-finite}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{schemes-lemma-section-immersion}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-closed-immersion-finite}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{lemma-composition-finite}", "SPACE_0001": "\\ ", "SPACE_0002": "\\ ", "SPACE_0003": "\\ ", "SPACE_0004": "\\ ", "SPACE_0005": "\\ "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:d237dc56bece32f3cf9f605a2a9f42a54ce9f30fa69baacc55b67da3c651dfe5", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8c6eb7aae0677c0849f5d1ea62739db11c8b6270ca2d04b4597ecc5d2cf43a61", "source_text": "Assume <MATH_0001> is finite (resp.<SPACE_0001>integral) and <MATH_0002> separated.\nThe base change <MATH_0003> is finite (resp.<SPACE_0002>integral) by\nLemma <REF_0001>.\nThe morphism <MATH_0004> is\na closed immersion as <MATH_0005> is separated, see\nSchemes, Lemma <REF_0002>.\nA closed immersion is finite (resp.<SPACE_0003>integral),\nsee Lemma <REF_0003>.\nThe composition of finite (resp.<SPACE_0004>integral) morphisms is finite\n(resp.<SPACE_0005>integral),\nsee Lemma <REF_0004>. Thus we win.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:aa177a038146048a49ffcb7486037cd18d5174285286c701d59784a51fed72b9", "unit_id": "tag:035D:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01WG", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to Y$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$f$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-finite-monomorphism-closed}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:a07bb346fb3b8a2c9985282f7fa56619acfc9423bc66525cd6b2506ac6d7c18f", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c6f65f2e8590bf606e6ca6671ea02832d55dd588e334caf93cb7d53b5cc594c3", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of schemes.\nIf <MATH_0002> is finite and a monomorphism, then <MATH_0003> is a closed immersion.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:94c65cd4e976b00d024f95eddd1a439b90c0d27dc748724199f8da3431d6f8b7", "unit_id": "tag:03BB:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01WG", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-finite-epimorphism-surjective}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:b17809788249112209eacf2c833fa70419984c6a5fb5bb8e240b423283b4dce8", "source_text": "This reduces to\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f2a115cb32f646e0c04fdf0d72bf6d1e3ac0a840e1fcb3118aa625baaa8acfb3", "unit_id": "tag:03BB:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01WG", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-finite-projective}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:83700483794e70409f3955117428c5bfa397c7534907a373803adcdffb9c2f47", "source_text": "A finite morphism is projective.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b8e4fdb8687af2825809903093d5943c2a06e70c1b1f3666d7a9e9aea042e308", "unit_id": "tag:0B3I:statement"}
